# Cursor AI Rules for PHP Modernization
- Never refactor code purely for aesthetic reasons during upgrades.
- Preserve 100% input/output parity of all existing services and API endpoints.
- Stepwise jumps only: PHP 7.4 -> 8.0 -> 8.2 -> 8.4 -> 8.5+ (Latest) | Laravel 8 -> 9 -> 10 -> 11 -> 12+ (Latest).
- Neutralize all php2shell RCE vectors: block CGI argument injection, replace exec/system with Symfony Process, whitelist dynamic includes, and store uploads outside webroot.
